## Navigation Grid

| Key          | Action                       | Flavor Text                              |
|:-------------|:-----------------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| **Arrow Keys** | Move focus between emails    | Subtle step sound effect (retro, pleasant) |
| **Spacebar**   | Open selected email          | *"Jump to read."*                        |
| **Enter**      | Reply while reading          | *"Press Enter to continue to the next level."* |
| **Drag & Drop** | Move between folders         | Animate a tiny sprite walking across     |

